    partName: Paku
    localPosition: {x: 0.00030000508, y: 0.02520001, z: -0.012439489}
    visibleFrom: 0
    title:
      id: Paku Hulu
      en: Hilt Pin (Paku)
    regionalTerm: 'Betawi: paku / pasak gagang'
    material:
      id: Kuningan poles (pada model)
      en: Polished brass (on the model)
    philosophy:
      id: '[Draf] Diisi kurator setelah spesimen asli ditetapkan.'
      en: '[Draft] To be written by the curator once the real specimen is chosen.'
    craft:
      id: Paku keling kuningan yang menembus leher hulu dan tangkai puting bilah
        di dalamnya. Fungsinya mengunci gagang secara mekanis agar tidak melonggar
        saat golok diayunkan.
      en: A brass rivet passing through the horn neck and the internal blade tang.
        It mechanically locks the hilt in place so the handle never loosens during
        use.
    history:
      id: '[Draf] Diisi kurator setelah spesimen asli ditetapkan.'
      en: '[Draft] To be written by the curator once the real specimen is chosen.'
