    title:
      id: Salut (Pelindung Jari)
      en: Brass Guard (Salut)
    regionalTerm: 'Betawi/Sunda: salut, tadah'
    material:
      id: Kuningan muda poles ber-bevel (pada model)
      en: Beveled polished pale brass (on the model)
    philosophy:
      id: '[Draf] Diisi kurator setelah spesimen asli ditetapkan.'
      en: '[Draft] To be written by the curator once the real specimen is chosen.'
    craft:
      id: Pelindung logam di antara bilah dan gagang yang melebar melengkung ke sisi
        mata bilah. Salut memperkuat pangkal tanduk agar tidak pecah sekaligus menahan
        jari agar tidak tergelincir ke sisi tajam.
      en: A metal bolster between blade and hilt that flares gracefully toward the
        cutting edge. It reinforces the base of the horn grip against cracking while
        shielding the fingers from sliding onto the sharp edge.
    history:
