  - hotspotId: simpay
    partName: Simpay
    localPosition: {x: 0, y: -0.088, z: -0.012680888}
    visibleFrom: 0
    title:
      id: Simpay Kuningan
      en: Brass Bands (Simpay)
    regionalTerm: 'Betawi/Sunda: simpay, sumpai'
    material:
      id: Kuningan muda berukir motif tumpal/chevron & pita polos (pada model)
      en: Pale brass with engraved chevron motifs and smooth straps (on the model)
    philosophy:
      id: Secara filosofis, lilitan simpay yang saling mengunci melambangkan ikatan
        kekeluargaan, persatuan, dan keselarasan hidup bermasyarakat.
      en: Philosophically, the interlocking simpay rings represent family ties, unity,
        and harmony within the community.
    craft:
      id: "Empat belas lilitan pita kuningan \u2014 terdiri dari dua pita lebar berukir
        di bagian atas, sepuluh pita tipis sepanjang batang, dan sepasang pita di
        ujung bawah. Simpay mengikat belahan sarung agar tetap rapat dan tidak pecah
        terkena benturan."
      en: "Fourteen brass wraps \u2014 two wide engraved bands near the throat, ten
        slender straps along the shaft, and a twin pair near the tip. Simpay bands
        bind the sheath halves tightly so they resist cracking under impact."
    history:
      id: '[Draf] Diisi kurator setelah spesimen asli ditetapkan.'
      en: '[Draft] To be written by the curator once the real specimen is chosen.'
